{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:InformationTheory.AeonBoundary","@type":"LeanModule","name":"InformationTheory.AeonBoundary","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Set.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Set.BooleanAlgebra","lean:module:Mathlib.Order.Disjoint"],"declarations":4,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.aeonBoundary_disjoint","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.aeonBoundary_disjoint","kind":"theorem","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/aeon-boundary.lean#L43-L48","doc":"The boundary is disjoint from the aeon interior. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.mem_aeonBoundary","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.mem_aeonBoundary","kind":"theorem","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/aeon-boundary.lean#L37-L41","doc":"A boundary object lies in the closure but not in the aeon. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.aeonBoundary","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.aeonBoundary","kind":"def","line":25,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/aeon-boundary.lean#L25-L35","doc":"**Boundary of an aeon** `∂𝒜 = closure(𝒜) ∖ 𝒜°`.\n\nGiven the aeon `aeonObjs` (a subset of `Bun°`) and the closure\n`cl` of its directed diagrams inside `Bun(ℙ(V))`, the boundary is\nthe set-difference: the limit objects that are not themselves\nobservable.  These are the jet horizons / big-bang states with\n`Γ(𝒮, A₀) = 0`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:aeon-boundary","label":"def:aeon-boundary","md":"quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/aeon-boundary.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BunObject","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BunObject","kind":"def","line":22,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/information-theory/aeon-boundary.lean#L22-L23","doc":"An object of `Bun(ℙ(V))`, abstracted as its index. ","signatureChunk":0}]}